								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><font color="#0000ff" size="6"><strong><img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" />&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/upcomingevents.jpg" />&nbsp; <img src="/pics/1602/ss151.gif" /><br /><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1555"><img src="/pics/1602/RatheGamesLogo.JPG" />&nbsp;<br /></a></strong></font><br /><font size="2"><font color="#0000ff">Sunday, November the 28th, at 8pm cst, the Rathe Games will begin.&nbsp; Meet us in the center of the Nexus platform.&nbsp; As always, the Rathe games are open to all of Norrath, so invite your friends, your foes, your aquantices, and potential members to come.&nbsp; An event&nbsp;has been added!!&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Click the picture above to see what the Rathe Games are, and all the rules</font>.</font><br /><br /><img src="/pics/1602/Amy.jpg" /></p>
