								<p class="newsTitle">
									A request - 
									10/6/2004 4:21:09 PM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									<p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><strong><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Michaelmas"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: Magik"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><em>Hey gang!&nbsp; I need something from each of you.&nbsp; I need you to send me a biography of your character.&nbsp; Send a screenshot or 2 along with it. For the biography, try to think of where your character is from, who is their family, what are they passionate about?&nbsp; I'll check your grammar and what not before I post it on the site hehe.&nbsp; I'll help out however I can.&nbsp; I've been working on&nbsp;</em></font><a href="/custom.aspx?pid=1581"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><em>Amyana's biography</em></font></a><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><em> and although it's not yet finished, it gives you an idea of what I'm wanting.&nbsp; If you need help, send me a pm.&nbsp; I'm going to give 10 DKP for those who get their biographies to me before Halloween, 5DKP for those who get their biographies to me before November 15th, and 1 DKP for those who get their biographies to me before Christmas.&nbsp; So, get out those pens, and start writing!!!&nbsp; (Don't forget screenshots!)</em></font></span></span></strong></span><br /><br /><em><img src="/pics/1602/Amy.jpg" /><br /></em></p>
								</div>
